OL,3,GNEWSAThe WW1 memorial cottages still
OL,4,Ahousing veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs World War One drew to a close, an
OL,7,Farchitect was asked to design a
OL,8,Fmemorial to his regiment that would
OL,9,Falso serve a practical need.
OL,11,FNorwich-based Cecil Upcher served in
OL,12,Fthe 9th Battalion the Norfolk Regiment
OL,13,Fand had been "deeply affected by his
OL,14,Fexperience", said curator Kate Thaxton.
OL,16,FThe memorial was a set of homes for the
OL,17,Fregiment's disabled veterans and their
OL,18,Ffamilies in Sprowston, on the outskirts
OL,19,Fof Norwich. More than a century on,
OL,20,Fthey still house veterans.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
