OL,3,GNEWSAThe WW1 memorial cottages still
OL,4,Ahousing veterans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThaxton said: "There's something
OL,7,Fparticularly nice about a memorial that
OL,8,Fstill fulfils a need today and that I
OL,9,Fthink is a great legacy."
